xcess state arguments after them become the\nrule's schematic parameters. `2` for a connective over a `CompleteLattice` carrier; `0` for a\nmonomorphic operator. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.LatticeOp.numConst","kind":"def","line":162,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.LatticeOp.numConst","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.lean#L162-L162"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.LatticeOp.head\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">head</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.LatticeOp\">LatticeOp</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Head constant of the operator this split decomposes. Keys the `latticeOps` table. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.LatticeOp.head","kind":"def","line":157,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.LatticeOp.head","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.lean#L157-L157"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.LatticeOp.mk\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a></span> → <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.LatticeOp\">Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.LatticeOp</a></span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.LatticeOp.mk","kind":"ctor","line":152,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.LatticeOp.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.lean#L152-L167"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.LatticeOp\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">LatticeOp</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"How to decompose a lattice operator `head … s⃗` on the RHS of an entailment: the distribution and\nunfolding `rewrites` that saturate it, and the terminal `⊑`-introduction `terminals` that close the\nreduced form. `head` keys the split in the `latticeOps` table. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.LatticeOp","kind":"structure","line":152,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.LatticeOp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.lean#L152-L167"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameInferenceProc\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">FrameInferenceProc</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A frame inference procedure: from a `FrameInferenceInfo` (whose `providedFrame?` carries the\nframe of a matching `frames` clause, if any), optionally produce a `FrameSplit`; `none` leaves the\nspec to apply directly.\n\nThe procedure produces the frame and a proof of the split VC `pre ⊑ (op frame residualPre) s⃗`; it\nmust not assign `residualPre`, which the solver fills with the weakest footprint after the frame rule\napplies. Build the result with `FrameSplit.withDischargedSplitVC` (proof supplied) or\n`FrameSplit.withDeferredSplitVC` (split VC left as a subgoal). ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameInferenceProc","kind":"def","line":141,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameInferenceProc","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.lean#L141-L150"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule.frameIdx\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">FrameBackwardRule</span>.<span class=\"name\">frameIdx</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule\">FrameBackwardRule</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Position of the schematic frame (of type `R`). ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule.frameIdx","kind":"def","line":139,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule.frameIdx","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.lean#L139-L139"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule.splitVCIdx\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">FrameBackwardRule</span>.<span class=\"name\">splitVCIdx</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule\">FrameBackwardRule</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Position of the split VC `pre ⊑ (op frame W) s⃗`. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule.splitVCIdx","kind":"def","line":137,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule.splitVCIdx","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.lean#L137-L137"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule.rule\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">FrameBackwardRule</span>.<span class=\"name\">rule</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule\">FrameBackwardRule</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Apply.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.BackwardRule\">Meta.Sym.BackwardRule</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The backward rule concluding `pre ⊑ wp x Q E s⃗`. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule.rule","kind":"def","line":135,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule.rule","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.lean#L135-L135"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule.mk\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">FrameBackwardRule</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Apply.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.BackwardRule\">Lean.Meta.Sym.BackwardRule</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule\">Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule.mk","kind":"ctor","line":129,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.lean#L129-L139"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">FrameBackwardRule</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A frame backward rule together with the positions of its assignable subgoals in the applied\nrule's goal list: the schematic frame and the split VC `pre ⊑ (op frame W) s⃗`, where `W` is the\nweakest footprint baked into the rule. The positions are fixed at rule construction, so applying a\n`FrameSplit` assigns by index. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule","kind":"structure","line":129,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameBackwardRule","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.lean#L129-L139"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameSplit.withDischargedSplitVC\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">FrameSplit</span>.<span class=\"name\">withDischargedSplitVC</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">frame</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">residualPre</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId<