div>","info":{"doc":"The spec precondition instantiated at the call site, read off a speculative application of\n`specRule` to `goal` that is rolled back: the precondition VC's metavariables are frozen into a\ntelescope and reopened fresh in the restored context, so they outlive the rollback. `none` when the\nrule does not apply or leaves no precondition VC. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameInferenceInfo.specPre?","kind":"def","line":86,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameInferenceInfo.specPre?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.lean#L86-L104"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameInferenceInfo.mkResidualPre\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">FrameInferenceInfo</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkResidualPre</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameInferenceInfo\">FrameInferenceInfo</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/SymM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.SymM\">Meta.Sym.SymM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A fresh residual-precondition metavariable for a `FrameSplit`: synthetic-opaque; the procedure\nbuilds the split VC against it and leaves it unassigned. ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#