{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameSplit.mk","kind":"ctor","line":29,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameSplit.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.lean#L29-L46"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameSplit\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">FrameSplit</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"How the goal precondition frames through the frame operator: `vcgen` applies the frame rule with\nthe `frame`, discharging the split VC `pre ⊑ (op frame residualPre) s⃗` with `proof` and leaving\n`proof`'s `subgoals`. `residualPre` is the solver-owned metavariable for the residual precondition,\nwhich the solver fills after the frame rule applies.\n\nBuild a `FrameSplit` with `FrameSplit.withDischargedSplitVC` (proof supplied) or\n`FrameSplit.withDeferredSplitVC` (split VC left as one subgoal). ","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameSplit","kind":"structure","line":29,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameSplit","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Internal/VCGen/FrameProc.lean#L29-L46"}}],"imports":["Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.WPApp","Lean.Meta.AbstractMVars","Lean.Meta.AppBuilder","Lean.Meta.Sym.AlphaShareBuilder","Lean.Meta.Sym.Apply","Lean.Meta.Sym.InferType","Lean.Meta.Sym.InstantiateMVarsS","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Util","Std.Internal.Do.Order.Basic"],"instances":[{"className":"Inhabited","name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.instInhabitedFrameProcs","typeNames":["Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameProcs"]}],"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Internal.VCGen.FrameProc"}